Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 05:44:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] OnePlus 6 (enchilada): ath10k build path for the WCN3990

The radio's Linux driver lives on the SNOC as a bare qmi/qrtr client;
lx_ath10k.c wraps what the kernel build needs of it, with the lx-side
stubs (firmware, regulator, pwrseq, remoteproc) kept minimal. Build it
with REDWOOD_WIFI=ath10k; ath11k stays the default.
